(6618531, 988428, 10785, '<td valign="top">Very good concept. I am not sure if you were going for a vintage feel but I think the colors are a little flat and could use some vibrance or saturation enhancement. I think you could get in closer and eliminate some of the foreground and possibly shoot in landscape orientation. Great humor and fun shot overall!</td>', 'Very good concept. I am not sure if you were going for a vintage feel but I think the colors are a little flat and could use some vibrance or saturation enhancement. I think you could get in closer and eliminate some of the foreground and possibly shoot in landscape orientation. Great humor and fun shot overall!', '2011-12-14 20:06:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(6618532, 988488, 10785, '<td valign="top">I like the concept of the spotlight illuminating the ballons creating a focal point. I would like to see more balloons filling the frame and eliminating the background. A diffuser is necessary for the light. The light is washing out the color of the balloons. Also the hand is not necessary.</td>', 'I like the concept of the spotlight illuminating the ballons creating a focal point. I would like to see more balloons filling the frame and eliminating the background. A diffuser is necessary for the light. The light is washing out the color of the balloons. Also the hand is not necessary.', '2011-12-14 20:09:01.000000', NULL, 1),
