(6619065, 988410, 10785, '<td valign="top">Nice set up shot. A couple thoughts on this one on why I gave it a 5. You got good color which pops well. However I think the colors are somewhat random and don''t show any pattern or repetition which could have helped the composition. Also the ballons are somewhat inconsistent in size, especially at the top where the round shadow part is different sizes. I wold like to see this brighter without the light shining through at the front edge.</td>', 'Nice set up shot. A couple thoughts on this one on why I gave it a 5. You got good color which pops well. However I think the colors are somewhat random and don''t show any pattern or repetition which could have helped the composition. Also the ballons are somewhat inconsistent in size, especially at the top where the round shadow part is different sizes. I wold like to see this brighter without the light shining through at the front edge.', '2011-12-15 15:40:56.000000', NULL, 1),
