(6620300, 988125, 62249, '<td valign="top">Because this challenge allowed advanced editing, you could have improved the image by cleaning up the small imperfections, such as the bit of dust (or whatever) sticking off the lip of the right balloon and smoothing out the splotches on the same balloon.</td>', 'Because this challenge allowed advanced editing, you could have improved the image by cleaning up the small imperfections, such as the bit of dust (or whatever) sticking off the lip of the right balloon and smoothing out the splotches on the same balloon.', '2011-12-17 15:34:53.000000', NULL, 1),
