(6620302, 988456, 62249, '<td valign="top">This composition would work okay for stock photography because you''ve left lots of area for text. For this challenge, though, it seems like there''s too much empty frame that draws my attention away from the nicely backlit balloon.</td>', 'This composition would work okay for stock photography because you''ve left lots of area for text. For this challenge, though, it seems like there''s too much empty frame that draws my attention away from the nicely backlit balloon.', '2011-12-17 15:38:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(6620303, 988497, 62249, '<td valign="top">Like this a lot. B/W is a surprising choice for a balloon shot, but combined with the dreaminess of the overall image, it works well.</td>', 'Like this a lot. B/W is a surprising choice for a balloon shot, but combined with the dreaminess of the overall image, it works well.', '2011-12-17 15:39:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(6620304, 988508, 101702, '<td valign="top">Great fun shot and I like the composition. But what happened at the top of the pink balloon?! The editing work there looks really visible and detracts greatly.</td>', 'Great fun shot and I like the composition. But what happened at the top of the pink balloon?! The editing work there looks really visible and detracts greatly.', '2011-12-17 15:40:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(6620306, 988332, 62249, '<td valign="top">Interesting. I love the color palette. Oversharpened a little, but still an excellent photo.</td>', 'Interesting. I love the color palette. Oversharpened a little, but still an excellent photo.', '2011-12-17 15:41:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(6620307, 988421, 62249, '<td valign="top">Par-tay! Very cute.</td>', 'Par-tay! Very cute.', '2011-12-17 15:42:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(6620308, 988445, 101702, '<td valign="top">Am i missing the balloon?</td>', 'Am i missing the balloon?', '2011-12-17 15:42:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(6620310, 988410, 62249, '<td valign="top">Excellent title! And a good colorful shot, too.</td>', 'Excellent title! And a good colorful shot, too.', '2011-12-17 15:44:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(6620312, 988467, 62249, '<td valign="top">Very funny and well exposed.</td>', 'Very funny and well exposed.', '2011-12-17 15:44:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(6620317, 988444, 62249, '<td valign="top">Needs better lighting. You could still keep it dark and moody without making it so murky. Cute title.</td>', 'Needs better lighting. You could still keep it dark and moody without making it so murky. Cute title.', '2011-12-17 15:45:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(6620320, 988065, 62249, '<td valign="top">Excellent! Love the color, love the backlighting, love the originality of your take on the subject (even though the sphere on the right could be an apple for all I know).</td>', 'Excellent! Love the color, love the backlighting, love the originality of your take on the subject (even though the sphere on the right could be an apple for all I know).', '2011-12-17 15:47:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(6620323, 988036, 62249, '<td valign="top">Composition is okay. Work on your focus, and try using shallower DOF to blur the background elements that distract from the subject. Probably a lot of people will say this photo because it doesn''t meet the challenge. Not too many people will agree that this is a "balloon."</td>', 'Composition is okay. Work on your focus, and try using shallower DOF to blur the background elements that distract from the subject. Probably a lot of people will say this photo because it doesn''t meet the challenge. Not too many people will agree that this is a "balloon."', '2011-12-17 15:49:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(6620324, 988297, 62249, '<td valign="top">I find myself wanting either more light on the model so I can see her face a little better, or less so that she''s fully silhouetted. Nevertheless, it''s a good, fun shot, and I like the minimal color palette.</td>', 'I find myself wanting either more light on the model so I can see her face a little better, or less so that she''s fully silhouetted. Nevertheless, it''s a good, fun shot, and I like the minimal color palette.', '2011-12-17 15:50:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(6620325, 988492, 62249, '<td valign="top">Great concept and shot reasonably well too.</td>', 'Great concept and shot reasonably well too.', '2011-12-17 15:51:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(6620328, 988405, 62249, '<td valign="top">The composition is too helter skelter. No obvious subject, just too much stuff to look at. Each element in the photo could be interesting in and of itself, but all the different elements at once equal a cluttered shot.</td>', 'The composition is too helter skelter. No obvious subject, just too much stuff to look at. Each element in the photo could be interesting in and of itself, but all the different elements at once equal a cluttered shot.', '2011-12-17 15:52:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(6620329, 988488, 62249, '<td valign="top">Overexposed in the center, and the light switch detracts from shot. I like your concept, and this could have been more successful if you''d just used the hand and the lower green balloon in your composition. That part of the shot is pretty interesting and has good highlights/shadows.</td>', 'Overexposed in the center, and the light switch detracts from shot. I like your concept, and this could have been more successful if you''d just used the hand and the lower green balloon in your composition. That part of the shot is pretty interesting and has good highlights/shadows.', '2011-12-17 15:54:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(6620338, 988360, 49018, '<td valign="top">I like this, a nice portrait. Honestly I would never guessed what the thing was without the title and I wonder if switching focus from him to the BPCC (is there such acronym ? :) would have helped me guessing. However, I really never seen anything like that before, perhaps in other countries it''s a pretty common thing in science classes and people will recognize it more readily :)</td>', 'I like this, a nice portrait. Honestly I would never guessed what the thing was without the title and I wonder if switching focus from him to the BPCC (is there such acronym ? :) would have helped me guessing. However, I really never seen anything like that before, perhaps in other countries it''s a pretty common thing in science classes and people will recognize it more readily :)', '2011-12-17 16:18:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(6620339, 988460, 49018, '<td valign="top">That''s a pretty clever idea and a bit mysterious looking. 8</td>', 'That''s a pretty clever idea and a bit mysterious looking. 8', '2011-12-17 16:20:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(6620341, 988125, 49018, '<td valign="top">Rotated 180 degrees the red one makes for a pretty scary pareidolia, 90 degree clockwise and yellow one is right out of pacman :D 8</td>', 'Rotated 180 degrees the red one makes for a pretty scary pareidolia, 90 degree clockwise and yellow one is right out of pacman :D 8', '2011-12-17 16:26:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(6620342, 988444, 49018, '<td valign="top">Surrealistic portrait :)<br/>The banded noise in a sense helps the feeling (uhh, and looks familiar, pentax k10d by any chance? :) 8</td>', 'Surrealistic portrait :)The banded noise in a sense helps the feeling (uhh, and looks familiar, pentax k10d by any chance? :) 8', '2011-12-17 16:29:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(6620351, 988053, 49018, '<td valign="top">Interesting one, she ind of reminds of one of the characters from bladerunner. Probably I woudl have liked it even more with steampunk style makeup and no glass, but I am sure many will love the no string attached romance feeling :) 7</td>', 'Interesting one, she ind of reminds of one of the characters from bladerunner. Probably I woudl have liked it even more with steampunk style makeup and no glass, but I am sure many will love the no string attached romance feeling :) 7', '2011-12-17 16:35:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(6620353, 988421, 49018, '<td valign="top">Never sure if that was the intention, but I find these guys definetely scary :)</td>', 'Never sure if that was the intention, but I find these guys definetely scary :)', '2011-12-17 16:36:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(6620360, 988455, 49018, '<td valign="top">Enigmatic tree..</td>', 'Enigmatic tree..', '2011-12-17 16:40:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(6620361, 988452, 49018, '<td valign="top">Interesting towering perspective from below and really perfect, almost glassy ballons. I wondered if this is some kind of statue. Not sure why, but with the title it reminds me of ''The Truman Show'' :)</td>', 'Interesting towering perspective from below and really perfect, almost glassy ballons. I wondered if this is some kind of statue. Not sure why, but with the title it reminds me of ''The Truman Show'' :)', '2011-12-17 16:44:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(6620363, 987592, 49018, '<td valign="top">Menacing, straight form the ''50s movies :)</td>', 'Menacing, straight form the ''50s movies :)', '2011-12-17 16:45:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(6620369, 988438, 49018, '<td valign="top">I find the HDR look a bit too strong to my taste, but, wel, it''s just my taste.. I like the repetition pattern. Actually, the thing I find more interesting in the image are the reflections on the baloons themselves, in particular in the second one (an alien straight from Mars Attacks?)</td>', 'I find the HDR look a bit too strong to my taste, but, wel, it''s just my taste.. I like the repetition pattern. Actually, the thing I find more interesting in the image are the reflections on the baloons themselves, in particular in the second one (an alien straight from Mars Attacks?)', '2011-12-17 16:50:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(6620370, 988346, 49018, '<td valign="top">Woah, that''s what I call stellar reflections :)</td>', 'Woah, that''s what I call stellar reflections :)', '2011-12-17 16:51:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(6620371, 988502, 49018, '<td valign="top">I this just after release from school? A continued joy :)</td>', 'I this just after release from school? A continued joy :)', '2011-12-17 16:52:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(6620372, 988484, 49018, '<td valign="top">Selective saturation and muted colours work pretty well conveying the mood here:)</td>', 'Selective saturation and muted colours work pretty well conveying the mood here:)', '2011-12-17 16:53:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(6620373, 988428, 49018, '<td valign="top">I like the idea, pretty funny :)<br/>I think it would have worked even better if the bottle was opened and the cap scattered around, anf if the cigarette looked like burning.</td>', 'I like the idea, pretty funny :)I think it would have worked even better if the bottle was opened and the cap scattered around, anf if the cigarette looked like burning.', '2011-12-17 16:57:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(6620374, 988332, 49018, '<td valign="top">I have seen this guy before :) Great post-processing and choic eof hue, and my favourite among the staged one in the challenge, very drammatic. 9</td>', 'I have seen this guy before :) Great post-processing and choic eof hue, and my favourite among the staged one in the challenge, very drammatic. 9', '2011-12-17 17:02:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(6620375, 988445, 49018, '<td valign="top">Straight out of a very scary movie, and something else which I don''t get :)</td>', 'Straight out of a very scary movie, and something else which I don''t get :)', '2011-12-17 17:03:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(6620376, 988322, 49018, '<td valign="top">Interesting fantasy, the ballons are finally having fun :)</td>', 'Interesting fantasy, the ballons are finally having fun :)', '2011-12-17 17:05:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(6620377, 988458, 49018, '<td valign="top">Scripta manent, thoughts volant..<br/>Pretty disturbing ones she''s having, scary racing cars? Terminator delivering a cake? Probably I should get a new monitor or a new brain, whatever comes cheaper :)</td>', 'Scripta manent, thoughts volant..Pretty disturbing ones she''s having, scary racing cars? Terminator delivering a cake? Probably I should get a new monitor or a new brain, whatever comes cheaper :)', '2011-12-17 17:11:43.000000', NULL, 1),
