(6620649, 988484, 140537, '<td valign="top">I love this image. The partially deflated balloon. The irony and the awkward, sterotypical attempt to bring color into rather banal scene. Well done.<br/>Great use of the partial color technique. (Or is this office really that drab?)</td>', 'I love this image. The partially deflated balloon. The irony and the awkward, sterotypical attempt to bring color into rather banal scene. Well done.Great use of the partial color technique. (Or is this office really that drab?)', '2011-12-18 10:04:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(6620650, 988442, 140537, '<td valign="top"><strike>This does not appear to be displaying properly. On the thumbnail summary, it looks like the title. When I view the photo separately, it is rotated 90 degrees and looks very pinched.</strike> <br/>Glas I came back to tis photo. It is displaying properly for me now and I like it much better. Unusual composition.</td>', 'This does not appear to be displaying properly. On the thumbnail summary, it looks like the title. When I view the photo separately, it is rotated 90 degrees and looks very pinched. Glas I came back to tis photo. It is displaying properly for me now and I like it much better. Unusual composition.', '2011-12-18 10:07:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(6620653, 988296, 140537, '<td valign="top">Great work on the collage, but I don''t find the photo all that interesting.</td>', 'Great work on the collage, but I don''t find the photo all that interesting.', '2011-12-18 10:26:40.000000', NULL, 1),
