(6622391, 988332, 141542, '<td valign="top">This is an extraordinary image.  10/10.  My first place pick.  The color is chosen perfectly and I feel like you have conveyed wind well, in both the pose and your composition of the clouds.  I can''t identify one thing lacking in this image.  <br/> <br/>Well done.</td>', 'This is an extraordinary image.  10/10.  My first place pick.  The color is chosen perfectly and I feel like you have conveyed wind well, in both the pose and your composition of the clouds.  I can''t identify one thing lacking in this image.   Well done.', '2011-12-20 14:05:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(6622392, 988456, 141542, '<td valign="top">Very crisp and beautifully composed silhouette along with some very appealing colors make this an excellent image.  This is certainly a big contender for the this challenge.  9/10.</td>', 'Very crisp and beautifully composed silhouette along with some very appealing colors make this an excellent image.  This is certainly a big contender for the this challenge.  9/10.', '2011-12-20 14:06:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(6622393, 988314, 141542, '<td valign="top">The color choice in this image is really what made it special, but your processing takes that even further.  You''ve done a great job taking a potentially cliche image and making it very appealing.  Well done.  8/10.</td>', 'The color choice in this image is really what made it special, but your processing takes that even further.  You''ve done a great job taking a potentially cliche image and making it very appealing.  Well done.  8/10.', '2011-12-20 14:07:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(6622394, 988473, 141542, '<td valign="top">Wondeful composition, and while the story may be instantly clear and a simple one, it is still poignant.  <br/> <br/>Great job!  9/10.</td>', 'Wondeful composition, and while the story may be instantly clear and a simple one, it is still poignant.   Great job!  9/10.', '2011-12-20 14:08:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(6622395, 988418, 141542, '<td valign="top">Awesome.  I love the streaks of water around the bottom of the balloon, and the particles jumping out.  Those items really show the quality of detail you''ve surrounded your subject with, keeping it intersting.  The strong shape of the balloon is immediately intriguing to the eye.<br/> <br/>9/10.</td>', 'Awesome.  I love the streaks of water around the bottom of the balloon, and the particles jumping out.  Those items really show the quality of detail you''ve surrounded your subject with, keeping it intersting.  The strong shape of the balloon is immediately intriguing to the eye. 9/10.', '2011-12-20 14:09:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(6622396, 988502, 141542, '<td valign="top">This is precious and an excellent choice for this challenge.  The B&amp;W conversion only lends more strength to an image that says a great deal.  A rare opportunity to use selective color and not get berated for it. (I hope that''s the case, otherwise, for shame!)</td>', 'This is precious and an excellent choice for this challenge.  The B&W conversion only lends more strength to an image that says a great deal.  A rare opportunity to use selective color and not get berated for it. (I hope that''s the case, otherwise, for shame!)', '2011-12-20 14:10:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(6622397, 988460, 141542, '<td valign="top">Clever!  I used a similar idea for my "Things that Go Together II" entry.  A lovely, crisp silhouette. <br/> <br/>My only comment is this:  The "light coming from the balloon" is made less realisitic by the lack of light on this gentleman''s face.  It''s obvious he has no light near him, yet he is holding this incredibly bright balloon.  Just my two cents, it''s a great shot.</td>', 'Clever!  I used a similar idea for my "Things that Go Together II" entry.  A lovely, crisp silhouette.  My only comment is this:  The "light coming from the balloon" is made less realisitic by the lack of light on this gentleman''s face.  It''s obvious he has no light near him, yet he is holding this incredibly bright balloon.  Just my two cents, it''s a great shot.', '2011-12-20 14:12:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(6622398, 988328, 141542, '<td valign="top">Idea: Strange + Lighting: Gorgeous + Expression: Fantastic<br/> <br/>That looks like an equation for an 8/10 image to me.</td>', 'Idea: Strange + Lighting: Gorgeous + Expression: Fantastic That looks like an equation for an 8/10 image to me.', '2011-12-20 14:12:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(6622402, 988404, 141542, '<td valign="top">I can''t explain exactly why I love this image, other than it has a sense of mystery about it that is really intriguing.  One criticism...that damn light at the bottom left corner...distracting as all hell.</td>', 'I can''t explain exactly why I love this image, other than it has a sense of mystery about it that is really intriguing.  One criticism...that damn light at the bottom left corner...distracting as all hell.', '2011-12-20 14:13:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(6622403, 987599, 141542, '<td valign="top">Excellent portrait shot which gave me a moment of laughter, well done!</td>', 'Excellent portrait shot which gave me a moment of laughter, well done!', '2011-12-20 14:14:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(6622404, 988493, 141542, '<td valign="top">I''m not sure how you achieved this, but it''s pretty fascinating.  I like the monochromatic nature of it, as well.  Very artistic, and a good abstract...if that''s the correct definition.</td>', 'I''m not sure how you achieved this, but it''s pretty fascinating.  I like the monochromatic nature of it, as well.  Very artistic, and a good abstract...if that''s the correct definition.', '2011-12-20 14:14:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(6622405, 988065, 141542, '<td valign="top">This is just a very nifty image altogether.</td>', 'This is just a very nifty image altogether.', '2011-12-20 14:15:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(6622406, 988424, 141542, '<td valign="top">Good capture of emotion (regardless of whether or not it was staged [obviously...]) and looks right fundamentally.  Not as strong as a few of the other entries, but still a great shot.</td>', 'Good capture of emotion (regardless of whether or not it was staged [obviously...]) and looks right fundamentally.  Not as strong as a few of the other entries, but still a great shot.', '2011-12-20 14:16:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(6622407, 988489, 141542, '<td valign="top">P<br/> <br/>Haha, I am editing this comment from "P" to an actual comment! <br/> <br/>I thought this was a great shot, and I think you must''ve found this by chance or gone through some real trouble getting this together, and even more to have it cooperate in such a photogenic way.<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2011-12-21 05:53:59.</i></td>', 'P Haha, I am editing this comment from "P" to an actual comment!  I thought this was a great shot, and I think you must''ve found this by chance or gone through some real trouble getting this together, and even more to have it cooperate in such a photogenic way.', '2011-12-20 14:17:11.000000', '2011-12-21 05:53:59.000000', 1),
(6622408, 987922, 141542, '<td valign="top">Clever!  It really is an interesting idea, and a good image fundamentally. 7/10</td>', 'Clever!  It really is an interesting idea, and a good image fundamentally. 7/10', '2011-12-20 14:17:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(6622409, 988377, 141542, '<td valign="top">Ha!  Clever.  I give you a 7 at least for effort, and if this were just any old warm lake it might be a six.</td>', 'Ha!  Clever.  I give you a 7 at least for effort, and if this were just any old warm lake it might be a six.', '2011-12-20 14:18:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(6622411, 988125, 141542, '<td valign="top">I like the lighting in this shot.  The proximity to the balloons did you more justice than getting farther back too.  Good job!</td>', 'I like the lighting in this shot.  The proximity to the balloons did you more justice than getting farther back too.  Good job!', '2011-12-20 14:20:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(6622413, 988031, 141542, '<td valign="top">This reminds me of Mario Kart.  A great shot, I kind of wish the front dog were sharp as well, but it''s still a good image!</td>', 'This reminds me of Mario Kart.  A great shot, I kind of wish the front dog were sharp as well, but it''s still a good image!', '2011-12-20 14:20:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(6622414, 987639, 141542, '<td valign="top">I think this is a cool idea that could''ve been executed better.  It''s still an above average image though!</td>', 'I think this is a cool idea that could''ve been executed better.  It''s still an above average image though!', '2011-12-20 14:21:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(6622415, 988452, 141542, '<td valign="top">The perspective of this image is unusual.  A good shot, but I feel like the "End of a Wonderful Day" would look differently.  Personal opinion I suppose!</td>', 'The perspective of this image is unusual.  A good shot, but I feel like the "End of a Wonderful Day" would look differently.  Personal opinion I suppose!', '2011-12-20 14:22:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(6622418, 988421, 141542, '<td valign="top">I like your idea, but it could have been executed much better I think.  It''s just not incredibly appealing and doesn''t make you feel as though you are looking at something other than some stuffed animals with props. Your goal should be to embrace the title you''ve chosen, and, using your 2D workspace, somehow make these stuffed animals appear a little more...exciting.</td>', 'I like your idea, but it could have been executed much better I think.  It''s just not incredibly appealing and doesn''t make you feel as though you are looking at something other than some stuffed animals with props. Your goal should be to embrace the title you''ve chosen, and, using your 2D workspace, somehow make these stuffed animals appear a little more...exciting.', '2011-12-20 14:28:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(6622419, 988443, 141542, '<td valign="top">An interesting idea, but I think the far right individual makes the image a little lopsided.  Had he been a couple of feet closer to the center, the shot would be that much stronger.</td>', 'An interesting idea, but I think the far right individual makes the image a little lopsided.  Had he been a couple of feet closer to the center, the shot would be that much stronger.', '2011-12-20 14:29:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(6622420, 988231, 141542, '<td valign="top">I laughed.  Clever shot.</td>', 'I laughed.  Clever shot.', '2011-12-20 14:30:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(6622425, 988297, 141542, '<td valign="top">So, this is a really cool idea, but I have one major problem with it.  The "partial silhouette"...I''m a budding amateur, and I try to keep my mind pretty open when it comes to this stuff, but I also agree with many photographers who don''t like partial silhouettes.<br/> <br/>This image would be an 8 for me, if it were a true silhouette, but as is I give you a 6.  Still a very nifty idea.</td>', 'So, this is a really cool idea, but I have one major problem with it.  The "partial silhouette"...I''m a budding amateur, and I try to keep my mind pretty open when it comes to this stuff, but I also agree with many photographers who don''t like partial silhouettes. This image would be an 8 for me, if it were a true silhouette, but as is I give you a 6.  Still a very nifty idea.', '2011-12-20 14:32:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(6622426, 988438, 141542, '<td valign="top">I like the processing!</td>', 'I like the processing!', '2011-12-20 14:32:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(6622427, 988488, 141542, '<td valign="top">I like this idea, but I wish it was not blown out in the middle...I''m sure you wanted to achieve this, I just have no idea why.</td>', 'I like this idea, but I wish it was not blown out in the middle...I''m sure you wanted to achieve this, I just have no idea why.', '2011-12-20 14:33:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(6622429, 988296, 141542, '<td valign="top">A clever idea, but compared to your peers in this challenge it is just average.</td>', 'A clever idea, but compared to your peers in this challenge it is just average.', '2011-12-20 14:33:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(6622430, 988360, 141542, '<td valign="top">A good shot, conveying motion/excitement in a fairly static subject.</td>', 'A good shot, conveying motion/excitement in a fairly static subject.', '2011-12-20 14:33:55.000000', NULL, 1),
